  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The propose cycle parking spaces for staff/visitors/children must be implemented in accordance with The Local Plan Policy DMT3 and The London Plan 2021 policy T5. Thereafter, it shall be retained as such in perpetuity.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to occupation of the children&#x27;s care home, a Noise Management Plan shall be&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;submitted to the Local\r\nPlanning Authority (LPA) for approval in writing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The premises shall be used as a children&#x27;s care home for four child residents and for no other purpose (including any other purpose in Class C2 of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987 (as amended) (or in any provision equivalent to that Class in any statutory instrument revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification)).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Existing Plans - drawing no. LC/01 - dated 18/07/2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed Plans - drawing no. LC/02 - dated 02/08/2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Location Plan - ref: PP-14240224v1 - dated 08 August 2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bike Store Photographs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Planning Statement&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Community Facility Need Statement&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Operational Management Plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fire Safety Statement&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;No other drawings or documents apply.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
